    "long_instructions": "# Select and Filter Ocean Heat Data\r\n\r\nUse AI Tutor to build and explain code that answers:\r\n\r\n- **What was the average Ocean Heat Content in 2000?**\r\n\r\nAfter each step, review AI Tutor’s code and run the program.\r\n\r\n1. Create a DataFrame named `year_df` containing the `Year` and `Ocean Heat Content` columns.\r\n2. Filter `year_df` to include only entries from `2000`.\r\n3. Calculate and print the mean `Ocean Heat Content` for the filtered data.\r\n\r\nHow does the filtering expression decide which rows to keep?\r\n\r\nWhat was the average Ocean Heat Content in 2000?",
